    "# 💹 Module 5: Market Price Prediction System\n",
    "## Bharat Krishi AI — Intelligent Agriculture Decision Support System\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** Daily Commodity Prices India Mandis (Agmarknet Format)  \n",
    "**Source:** Kaggle — khandelwalmanas/daily-commodity-prices-india  \n",
    "\n",
    "> **Note:** If you have the original CSV, replace the dataset generation block in Step 2  \n",
    "> with: `df = pd.read_csv('your_file.csv')`\n",
    "\n",
    "| Feature | Description |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| State | Indian state |\n",
    "| District | District name |\n",
    "| Market / Mandi | Market/mandi name |\n",
    "| Commodity | Crop/commodity |\n",
    "| Variety | Variety of commodity |\n",
    "| Grade | Quality grade |\n",
    "| Arrival_Date | Date of price record |\n",
    "| Min_Price | Minimum price (₹/quintal) |\n",
    "| Max_Price | Maximum price (₹/quintal) |\n",
    "| **Modal_Price** | **Target — most common price (₹/quintal)** |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["---\n## 📦 Section 1 — Install & Import Libraries"]
